WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.429 --> 00:00:03.919
Yeah, this is like actually kind of real.

00:00:03.919 --> 00:00:05.310
MSG is magic.

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:06.310
It's truly magic.

00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:08.760
And there's all this idea that, like, it's
like, bad for you or whatever, but it’s

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:09.760
just not.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:10.760
That’s like, a lot of that's just fake.

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:16.010
But, I did this like whole deep dive on MSG
because I like to eat Doritos for breakfast.

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:17.390
Like who doesn't like Doritos for breakfast?

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:19.070
A lot of people, but I do.

00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:22.519
And what I learned is that the key ingredient
is MSG.

00:00:22.519 --> 00:00:25.090
Like Doritos are just coated in MSG.

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:29.980
What it does is it tricks your brain into
thinking that you're eating meat like some

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:35.420
sort of, like protein rich, delicious thing,
which is like our ancestors needed that to

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:36.420
survive.

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:42.310
And so we just love MSG and that's how you're
able to take a chip like a Dorito, which is

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:48.480
just like a refined corn paste that has been
smashed and then like fried and baked and

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:49.699
make it so delicious.

00:00:49.699 --> 00:00:55.620
You just sprinkle some of this magic powder
on there and you have a Dorito, and I eat

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:57.119
Doritos for breakfast like all the time.

